    <ferc:ControlOverRespondentTextBlock id="f-1341" contextRef="c-14">&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;New York Transco, LLC (the &amp;quot;Company&amp;quot; or &amp;quot;NY Transco&amp;quot;), a New York limited liability company (&amp;quot;LLC&amp;quot;) was formed in November2014, by affiliates of the four investor-owned electric utilities in New York. The members of the Company and their respective ownership percentages for projects under development and in-service, with the exception of the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)"&gt;Propel NY Energy Alternate Solution 5 (the &amp;quot;Propel Project&amp;quot;) are as&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;follows: Consolidated Edison Transmission,LLC (&amp;quot;CET&amp;quot;) (45.652%); Grid NYLLC (&amp;quot;Grid NY&amp;quot;) (28.261%); Avangrid Networks New York TransCo,LLC (&amp;quot;Avangrid&amp;quot;) (19.973%); and Central Hudson Electric Transmission LLC (&amp;quot;CHET&amp;quot;) (6.114%) (collectively, the &amp;quot;Members&amp;quot;). The ownership percentages for the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)"&gt;Propel Project are as follows: CET&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt; (41.766%); Grid NY (28.261%); Avangrid (19.973%); and CHET (10.000%).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</ferc:ControlOverRespondentTextBlock>
    <ferc:PaymentsForRetirementOfCommonStockFinancingActivities id="f-1343" contextRef="c-14" unitRef="u-02" decimals="0">14634693</ferc:PaymentsForRetirementOfCommonStockFinancingActivities>
