			&lt;span&gt;1,027,372,329&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 			&lt;/table&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 12pt; margin-left: 28.8pt; margin-bottom: 10pt; text-indent: -28.8pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Arial Bold&amp;quot;; font-weight: bold"&gt;5.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 20.46pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;Debt&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 10pt; margin-left: 28.8pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: justify; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;Revolving Credit Agreement&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 12pt; margin-left: 28.8pt; margin-bottom: 10pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;On November 27, 2019, the Company originally entered into a $100 million revolving credit agreement (the &amp;quot;November 2019 CA&amp;quot;) to fund all related project activities for the Segment B Project, which was amended and extended several times, resulting in a total credit facility of $370 million, a maturity date of January 31, 2025 and a provision to reduce the commitment under the agreement to $100 million upon permanently financing the cost of the Segment B Project. (the &amp;quot;Amended November 2019 CA&amp;quot;).&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 10pt; margin-left: 28.8pt; margin-bottom: 10pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;In January 2024, the Company repaid the $335 million outstanding balance on the Amended November 2019 CA from the proceeds of the 2024 Senior Notes, as defined below. In November 2024, the Amended November 2019 CA was further amended to extend the maturity date to March 31, 2026 and for it to also be used to finance capital expenditures associated with the Propel Project.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;In March 2026, the Amended November 2019 CA was amended to extend the maturity date to March 31, 2027.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;As of December 31, 2025 and 2024, the Company had $75 and $65 million, respectively, outstanding under the Amended November 2019 CA at an interest rate of 4.77% and 5.32%, respectively. In March 2026, the Company borrowed an additional $20 million under the Amended November 2019 CA at an interest rate of 4.73%.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 10pt; margin-left: 28.8pt; margin-bottom: 10pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;As of December 31, 2025, three letters of credit were outstanding totaling $19.05 million related to the provision of security in accordance with the terms of interconnection agreements for the Segment B Project.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;In January 2026, a letter of credit for $5.0 million was terminated and a second letter of credit was reduced by $12.55 million, which resulted in two letters of credit outstanding, totaling $1.5 million.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 28.8pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: justify; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;Senior Notes&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 12pt; margin-left: 28.8pt; margin-bottom: 10pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;On May 24, 2016, the Company issued $104,387,000 aggregate principal amount of 2.91% Senior Notes, due May 24, 2046 (the &amp;quot;2016 Senior Notes&amp;quot;). The proceeds from the 2016 Senior Notes were used to finance capital expenditures.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 10pt; margin-left: 28.8pt; margin-bottom: 10pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;On January 9, 2024, the Company issued $350,000,000 aggregate principal amount of 5.45% Senior Notes, due January 9, 2054 (the &amp;quot;2025 Senior Notes&amp;quot;). The proceeds from the 2025 Senior Notes were used to repay the balance on the As Amended November 2022 CA and to finance capital expenditures.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 28.8pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: justify; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;Debt Covenants&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 28.8pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The Company's debt requires compliance with certain covenants, the most restrictive of which, include maintaining a ratio of consolidated debt to consolidated total capitalization of no more than 65% and that priority debt cannot exceed 15% of consolidated net worth. As of December 31, 2025, the Company is in compliance with all covenants.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 12pt; margin-left: 28.8pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; text-indent: -28.8pt; text-align: justify; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Arial Bold&amp;quot;; font-weight: bold"&gt;6.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 20.46pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;Income Taxes&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 12pt; margin-left: 28.8pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The following is a summary of the components of federal, state and local income taxes as of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)"&gt;December 31, 2025 and 2024&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="width: 415.45pt; margin-left: 35.55pt; border-collapse: collapse"&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 23.05pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 223.9pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: justify; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 1.45pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: center; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 61.2pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: middle"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: center; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;2025&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 1.45pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: middle"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: center; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 1.45pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: center; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 61.2pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: middle"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: center; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;2024&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 1pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 223.9pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: bottom"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;State and local income tax&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 1.45pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 61.2pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: bottom"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 1.45pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: bottom"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 1.45pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; page-b